## Common Pitfalls & Solutions

| Pitfall | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| Non-deterministic code | Use workflow.now() instead of Date.now() |
| Large workflow history | Use continue-as-new |
| Long-running activities | Add heartbeats |
| Workflows not completing | Check timeout configurations |
| Breaking changes | Use workflow versioning |
| Lost signals | Use buffered signals or queries |

→ See `temporal-activities.mdc` for activity implementation
→ See `temporal-error-handling.mdc` for error handling patterns
→ See `temporal-testing.mdc` for comprehensive testing strategies

